The  utility can be used to resolve the link dependencies of rump
kernel components.  This functionality is useful when desiring to
run a rump kernel with a given set of drivers, but not being sure
what the dependencies of those drivers are.  The output of is ac‐
cepted as command line input by The  command  line  options  are:
